# onvif - replies recorded from onvif_simple_server (roleoroleo, commit
# 7a2e335c, GPL-3.0, run in a throwaway container) on 2026-11-14: SOAP 1.2,
# prefix SOAP-ENV, faults with nested ter: subcodes and wsa5 headers,
# HTTP 400 for an authentication failure. Each is a fake answer:
# status, headers, an empty line, the body. Spliced into onvif_test.j.

